id: pm-ado-toolchain-1110
title: Separate create and update import contracts for SDK 2026.11.6
description: "Adapt https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/pull/97 and issue 98 without weakening null-clear or import behavior."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: "gh:unbraind/pm-ado#97","gh:unbraind/pm-ado#98"
created_at: "2026-11-10T12:41:13.918Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-10T13:55:37.621Z"
assignee: codex-toolchain-1110
claim_principal: codex-toolchain-1110
author: codex-toolchain-1110
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-10T12:41:17.100Z",codex-toolchain-1110,"Installed CHANGELOG 2026.11.5 identifies GH-1655 (pm-gh1655): explicit typed null-clear semantics distinguish create from update, including update-only closeReason:null. Issue 98 correctly diagnoses pmFields returning the full update shape and spreading it into create; unset:undefined did not narrow closeReason. Added a create mapper whose actual field subset excludes null clears and unset, plus an update mapper retaining assignment clearing and close finalization. Compiler fixtures accept new-item fields directly in public PmClient.create and reject update-only clears at that boundary."
  "2026-11-10T12:45:35.560Z",codex-toolchain-1110,"npm run typecheck, bun run typecheck and npm run build:test pass, including the @ts-expect-error regression. SDK owns all null-clear semantics; adapter types describe only fields actually emitted. Existing create/import and explicit-clear behavior tests remain unchanged. changelog:check passes; the requested incremental changelog command refuses an intentionally empty unreleased section, so full generation will preserve historical sections. Auto-merge disabled before any push."
  "2026-11-10T13:01:09.168Z",codex-toolchain-1110,"Reviewed and regenerated the current sync declaration snapshot and the tracked built sync outputs. Only the intended create/update option signatures changed; the published declaration baseline and unchanged consumer fixture remain untouched. Docstring gate passes: 19 files, 131 documented declarations. The queued full suite includes the exact declaration comparison and unchanged npm/Bun consumer contract tests."
  "2026-11-10T13:55:37.621Z",codex-toolchain-1110,"Live-pin clarification: before this work began, Dependabot had already advanced PR97 head 11bd9a8 to @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.11.7 (pm-changelog/pm-ops remain 2026.11.6). Preserve that current dependency commit. Rechecked npm run typecheck, bun run typecheck and npm run build:test against the real released 2026.11.6 SDK: all exit 0, including negative null-clear fixtures. Restored the unchanged installed/locked 2026.11.7 SDK afterward. The same three checks also pass on 2026.11.7; full npm tests and the release gate target that current PR pin. GH-1655 remains the underlying create/update type change."
